      {
        "id": 137340,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-15T02:52:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1. &nbsp;The shard moves to the hex with the target that was carrying it, and they are no longer carrying it. &nbsp;They have to pick it back up.</p><p>2. &nbsp;The next time that citizen takes a turn they stand up. &nbsp;Not before then.</p><p>3. &nbsp;That is a hazard space moving to a target, just like if Ra ran up to the target, it won't trigger that way.</p><p>4. &nbsp;\"On that line\" refers to the one of sight from Unity to the bot. &nbsp;The line of sight between 2 targets ends at the target. &nbsp;Arcing shot will not extend past the bot.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:13:41.534Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
