        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>1. &nbsp;The shard moves to the hex with the target that was carrying it, and they are no longer carrying it. &nbsp;They have to pick it back up.</p><p>2. &nbsp;The next time that citizen takes a turn they stand up. &nbsp;Not before then.</p><p>3. &nbsp;That is a hazard space moving to a target, just like if Ra ran up to the target, it won&#39;t trigger that way.</p><p>4. &nbsp;&quot;On that line&quot; refers to the one of sight from Unity to the bot. &nbsp;The line of sight between 2 targets ends at the target. &nbsp;Arcing shot will not extend past the bot.</p>",
