        "created_at": "2015-03-15T03:00:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So 1 and 2 we were playing right. 3 now leaves me with more confusion and just want to make sure I have read 4 right.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>so on 3. If I thrown down a hazard on a space like living pyre the second it goes down it doesn't activate if somone is standing in it?</p><p>to clarify on 4 the only things attracked by arcing shot is between unity and the bot. Does that include the bot?</p>",
