        "created_at": "2015-03-15T03:20:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hazard Spaces only trigger when a target moves into a Hazard Space or if they end their turn in a Hazard Space. A Hex becoming a Hazard Space is neither of those.</p>",
