      {
        "id": 137345,
        "name": "Paul",
        "username": "Paul",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-15T18:44:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><strong>morph147 said:</strong></p><blockquote><p><span>so on 3. If I thrown down a hazard on a space like living pyre the second it goes down it doesn't activate if somone is standing in it?</span></p></blockquote><p>That is correct! Hazard spaces only trigger 1) When a target enters them or 2) When a target ends its turn in them. Causing a hazard space to be made manifest (like by playing Living Pyre), or moving a hazard space onto someone (like by running up to them with Turret Bot) does not cause it to immediately trigger.</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:13:41.835Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
